    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "盆栽试验方案（ProtocolAudit Trial 3 测试稿）",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-2",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "研究类型：温室盆栽控制实验；研究对象：玉米幼苗、植物促生细菌及两类土壤；试验周期：28 d；方案版本：1.0。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-3",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "1 研究背景与目标",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-4",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "干旱胁迫会降低玉米幼苗的生长和养分吸收能力。植物促生细菌可能通过改善根系生长、改变根际微环境及促进土壤团聚体形成，增强植物对水分胁迫的耐受性。本研究采用一株具有胞外聚合物（EPS）产生能力的 Bacillus velezensis 菌株，评价其在不同水分条件和土壤背景下对玉米幼苗生长的影响，并探索根际 EPS、土壤团聚体稳定性与植物响应之间的关系。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-5",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "研究目标：（1）评价菌剂对玉米生长和干旱响应的影响；（2）分析根际 EPS、土壤团聚体稳定性与植物生长指标之间的关系；（3）初步判断该菌剂用于退化旱地土壤改良的应用潜力。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-6",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "2 研究假设",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-7",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-8",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "H1：接种植物促生菌剂能够提高玉米幼苗生物量，并减轻干旱处理对生长的抑制作用。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-8",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "H2：菌剂通过提高根际 EPS 水平和土壤团聚体稳定性改善土壤水分保持能力，进而促进玉米生长；EPS 是该效应的主要作用机制。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-9",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "H3：菌剂在退化黄土和参考农田土壤中均能产生稳定的促生效果，28 d 盆栽结果可为退化旱地的推广应用提供依据。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-10",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "3 材料与试验条件",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-11",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "3.1 供试材料",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-12",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "植物材料为玉米（Zea mays L.）同一商品批次种子。菌株为实验室保存的 EPS 产生菌 Bacillus velezensis，试验前在 LB 培养基中培养至对数生长期。菌液离心收集后以无菌生理盐水重悬，并加入海藻糖保护剂，最终接种液浓度调整为约 1×10^8 CFU/mL。所有接种处理均使用同一批培养所得菌液。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-13",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "供试土壤包括退化黄土（L）和参考农田土壤（R），分别采集后风干、过 2 mm 筛并混匀。每盆装土 3.0 kg。试验前测定土壤 pH、有机质、质地和初始有效磷，用于描述两类土壤的基本性质。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-14",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "3.2 温室条件",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-15",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "温室温度控制在 25±3 ℃，光周期约为 14 h 光照/10 h 黑暗。玉米出苗后选取长势相近的幼苗，每盆保留 3 株。水分处理开始前，将所有盆栽培养至三叶期。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-16",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "4 实验设计与分组",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-17",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-18",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "试验设置土壤类型、灌水水平和菌剂接种三个因素。土壤类型包括退化黄土和参考农田土壤；灌水水平包括正常供水和干旱胁迫；菌剂处理包括接种和不接种。每个处理组合设置 4 盆，共 32 盆。每盆保留 3 株玉米。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-18",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "t-1",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "因素 | 水平 1 | 水平 2 | 设置说明\n土壤类型 | 退化黄土（L） | 参考农田土壤（R） | 每盆装土 3.0 kg\n水分处理 | 正常供水（W） | 干旱胁迫（D） | 约 80% 与 40% 田间持水量\n菌剂处理 | 不接种（I−） | 接种（I+） | I+ 每盆施加 10 mL 接种液",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": null,
      "table_id": "t-1",
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "t-2",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "处理编号 | 土壤 | 水分 | 菌剂 | 盆数\nL-W-I− | 退化黄土 | 正常供水 | 不接种 | 4\nL-W-I+ | 退化黄土 | 正常供水 | 接种 | 4\nL-D-I− | 退化黄土 | 干旱胁迫 | 不接种 | 4\nL-D-I+ | 退化黄土 | 干旱胁迫 | 接种 | 4\nR-W-I− | 参考农田土壤 | 正常供水 | 不接种 | 4\nR-W-I+ | 参考农田土壤 | 正常供水 | 接种 | 4\nR-D-I− | 参考农田土壤 | 干旱胁迫 | 不接种 | 4\nR-D-I+ | 参考农田土壤 | 干旱胁迫 | 接种 | 4",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": null,
      "table_id": "t-2",
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "为便于灌水管理，正常供水处理统一放置在温室上层长台，干旱处理统一放置在下层长台；试验期间各盆保持原位。每张长台内按土壤和接种组合排列盆栽。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-19",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-20",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "5 处理实施",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-20",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-21",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "5.1 接种与对照",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-21",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-22",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "接种处理在水分胁迫开始前进行。每盆沿根际均匀加入 10 mL 菌液（约 1×10^8 CFU/mL），菌液中含海藻糖保护剂。不接种组每盆加入 10 mL 无菌生理盐水。接种后培养 48 h，再开始水分处理。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-22",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-23",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "5.2 水分控制",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-23",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-24",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "先测定两类土壤的田间持水量。正常供水组每日称重补水，使土壤含水量维持在约 80% 田间持水量；干旱组逐步降水并维持在约 40% 田间持水量。每天记录各组代表盆的质量变化，并据此调整同组盆栽的补水量。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-24",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-25",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "5.3 试验周期",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-25",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-26",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "从开始水分处理之日记为 D0，连续培养 28 d。D0、D7、D14、D21 和 D28 记录植株生长指标；根系和土壤终点指标按采样计划进行测定。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-26",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-27",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "6 测定指标与采样安排",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-27",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "t-3",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "时间 | 测定项目 | 取样方式 | 用途\nD0 | 株高、叶片数、SPAD | 每盆对 3 株编号植株测量 | 基线描述\nD7、D14、D21、D28 | 株高、SPAD | 同一盆内编号植株重复测量 | 生长动态\nD7、D14、D21 | 根际土壤 EPS | 每盆取约 20 g 根际土壤，采后补入等质量灭菌石英砂 | EPS 动态\nD14 | 根系形态、根系活力 | 每盆随机取 1 株，连根取出测定；剩余植株继续培养 | 中期根系响应\nD28 | 地上部/根系生物量、根系水力指标 | 收获每盆剩余植株并按盆记录 | 终点生长响应\nD28 | 水稳性团聚体、土壤含水特征 | 每盆混匀剩余土壤后取样 | 土壤结构响应",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": null,
      "table_id": "t-3",
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-28",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "株高从土表至最高叶尖测量；SPAD 使用叶绿素仪测定同一叶位。生物量样品在 105 ℃ 杀青后于 65 ℃ 烘至恒重。根际 EPS 采用水提取后测定总糖和总蛋白，并以干土质量归一化。土壤团聚体稳定性采用湿筛法测定，计算平均重量直径（MWD）。根系水力指标在收获后尽快测定。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-28",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-29",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "所有比色和酶标类测定均设置 3 个技术复孔，先取复孔均值，再作为该样品的测定结果。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-29",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-30",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "7 数据分析",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-30",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-31",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "对 D28 地上部生物量、根系生物量、MWD 和 EPS 等终点指标，采用三因素方差分析，因素为土壤类型、水分处理和菌剂处理；显著时采用 Tukey 法进行多重比较。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-31",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-32",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "对株高和 SPAD，在每个采样日分别进行单因素方差分析和 Tukey 多重比较，以判断各处理组合之间的差异。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-32",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-33",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "采用 Pearson 相关分析评估 EPS、MWD、SPAD 和生物量之间的相关性。若接种组同时表现为 EPS 增加、MWD 提高和生物量增加，则将其作为 EPS 介导促生机制的证据。显著性水平设为 p<0.05。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-33",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-34",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "8 预期结果与结论范围",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-34",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-35",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "预期接种菌剂能够提高玉米生物量，并减轻干旱处理的负面影响；接种处理可能提高根际 EPS 和水稳性团聚体比例。不同土壤背景下的效果大小可能存在差异。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-35",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-36",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "研究将结合植物生长、根系指标和土壤结构指标，讨论该菌剂用于退化旱地土壤改良的潜在价值。若各项指标方向一致，将进一步提出以 EPS 促进团聚体形成、改善水分条件为核心的作用解释，并据此讨论在退化旱地中的推广应用前景。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-36",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-37",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "9 质量控制与记录",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-37",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-38",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "每天记录温室温度、灌水量、盆栽异常和病虫害情况。所有样品使用唯一编号，编号包含土壤类型、水分处理、菌剂处理、盆号和采样日期。仪器测定前按各自操作规程校准；技术复孔的原始读数和均值均保留。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-38",
      "table_id": null,
      "section_path": null,
      "source": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-39",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "试验结束后汇总全部盆栽数据，检查异常值和缺失值，并在统计前核对处理编号、样品编号和采样日期。",
      "page_number": null,
      "paragraph_id": "p-39",
